<script>
/*
  Template JS:
  - Demo data stored in localStorage
  - Drag-and-drop reorder of tiles
  - Open overlay preview, edit preview content, add feedback
  - Simple simulated login (localStorage)
  - Hooks commented where to call backend APIs
